{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ae05fe58-bf8a-8e22-a368-c8e10ad6a22f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T12:36:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Angela Fiore. I got a shutoff warning in the mail. Pink paper. How much time do I have?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me pull that up. Can you give me your account number off the top of the notice, or the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Name's Fiore. Angela. Account number, hang on. [pause] Sorry, I'm flipping through a new cookbook. Just bought it. I put the notice somewhere in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. The name should be enough to find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Found it. Account ends in 4410."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:33:56-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Fiore, Angela. Okay, I see the notice. It's a past due water and sewer balance, and the notice went out last week. The date on it should say when the shutoff could happen. Do you see a date near the top?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:34:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "January thirtieth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so that's your deadline. You have until the end of the day on the twenty-ninth to be safe, really, to get a payment in before they schedule it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:34:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The twenty-ninth. So about a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little over a week, yeah. Eight days from today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can't pay it all at once. Is a payment plan possible?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be. Usually you pay a portion up front and then split the rest over a few months. I can't set the terms on this line, though. I'd put in a request for you and someone from the billing office will call you back to work it out. Is the number you're on right now good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:35:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, use 401-555-0159. That's my cell. This one is, same, actually. Yes, that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, zero one five nine. I'll note it. They usually get back within a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Next question. Can I pay online tonight? After City Hall closes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:35:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The online payment page on the city website is up around the clock. You can pay with a card or from a bank account. You'll need that account number again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And if I pay part tonight, does that stop the shutoff?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A partial payment helps, but it doesn't automatically stop it. That's why the payment plan request matters. Make a note of the payment, and when the billing office calls, tell them what you paid. They'll factor it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Pay something tonight, wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:36:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And if you don't hear from them by Friday, call us back and we'll chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:36:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Friday. Okay. Anything else I need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:36:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, that's everything. Keep the pink notice handy, it's got the account info on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Angela. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T12:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
